    "scope_note": "Informational, NOT pass/fail. Re-running BioCLIP or the detector is not something the multi-project refactor should be doing at all, so a change here means something re-ran that should not have -- worth investigating, but it is not the migration's acceptance criterion. A stale-but-matching evidence digest alongside a changed verdict digest localises a defect to the decision logic rather than the model.",
